Fixed all three review findings in `src/lsp.rs`:

- `set` now only reuses variable-like slots; `constant`/function/import/object/module get a fresh binding.
- Calls no longer fall back to a function shadowed by an earlier-ordered `set`; deferred resolution cannot resurrect it.
- Methods are call-only, so bare method names no longer resolve lexically.

Added three regression tests covering `constant` → `set`, call-after-shadowing, and bare method names. Updated `phases/phase-075/REPORT.md`.

Gates: `cargo fmt --check` pass, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` pass, `cargo test --all-targets` 2843 passed / 0 failed / 0 ignored, `../rbops/verify.sh "phase-075"` pass.
